{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEEDY STREAMER OVERLOAD: Typing of The Net</strong> is a typing game in which you enter internet lingo in a call-and-response format with a girl (OMGkawaiiAngel) who has a strong need for approval.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Call-and-Response Typing Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a viewer, typing out comments to respond!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215170/extras/f131615329f055ffcfb5dbf59e9e5887.avif?t=1751016010\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score depends on your <strong>typing speed and accuracy.</strong><br>Type fast and precisely to earn high scores and aim for the top &quot;S&quot; rank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215170/extras/ecc0a70044f19d678277a0169cfd10ca.avif?t=1751016010\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Flood of Internet Slang</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just a simple typing game!<br>All the keywords are <i>internet slang,</i> featuring over 200 phrases ranging from nostalgic classics to the latest trends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215170/extras/2de2aa9cca6b12dfd432aaebef591915.avif?t=1751016010\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For &quot;veteran netizens,&quot; it'll feel like a trip down memory lane, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while offering a fresh and entertaining perspective for &quot;younger generations.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you come across unfamiliar slang, no need to worry\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every term comes with a <strong>short explanation</strong> in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215170/extras/b1cadd1a743c4bf04d887441c180bbe0.avif?t=1751016010\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers three difficulty levels, speeding up as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep up with the pace of the internet?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215170/extras/f6ef10d734a046dafc617523b2015a2f.avif?t=1751016010\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"STAGE 1 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3215170/2c2ae96c8f7d8fb28f4931e69b81da2244b7e5ba.jpg"},{"name":"STAGE 2 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3215170/2c2ae96c8f7d8fb28f4931e69b81da2244b7e5ba.jpg"},{"name":"STAGE 3 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3215170/2c2ae96c8f7d8fb28f4931e69b81da2244b7e5ba.jpg"},{"name":"STAGE 1 RANK S","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3215170/2c2ae96c8f7d8fb28f4931e69b81da2244b7e5ba.jpg"},{"name":"STAGE 2 RANK S","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3215170/2c2ae96c8f7d8fb28f4931e69b81da2244b7e5ba.jpg"},{"name":"STAGE 3 RANK S","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3215170/2c2ae96c8f7d8fb28f4931e69b81da2244b7e5ba.jpg"},{"name":"SEARCH","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3215170/2c2ae96c8f7d8fb28f4931e69b81da2244b7e5ba.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/store